    },
    {
      "title": "8 · definition.table → tableName",
      "description": "**Propagates:** the parameter is named `tableName` in the repository.\n\n**Value here:** `tableName = 'orders_daily_summary'` (derived from code, not run).\n\n**Next →** interpolated into the SQL text (step 9).",
      "file": "src/repositories/reportRepository.js",
      "pattern": "async function summary\\((tableName)\\)",
