    {
      "title": "9 · ⚠️ SINK: FROM ${tableName}",
      "description": "**Sink:** `tableName` is written into the SQL text with a template literal; the query has no bound parameters.\n\n**Sink receives:** `... FROM orders_daily_summary` for `/reports/daily`, `... FROM orders_monthly_summary` for `/reports/monthly`, `... FROM undefined` for an inherited key (Postgres error → 500) (derived from code, not run).\n\n**Path summary:** A: `req.params.reportId` (user, admin only) → used only as a key, stops. B: `config/reports.js` table names (developers only) → 404 check → `FROM` text.",
      "file": "src/repositories/reportRepository.js",
